# Performance rules

## Defaults (do not regress)

- WebGL backdrop off unless user opt-in (`hud-reactor-3d` in localStorage).
- Two fonts only: Space Grotesk + IBM Plex Mono (`lib/fonts.js`).
- Defer typewriter (`useTypewriter` idle callback) and home gestures (dynamic import).
- `optimizePackageImports` in `next.config.mjs` — keep heavy packages tree-shaken.

## Before claiming "faster"

```sh
npm run perf:full
```

Compare `perf-reports/latest.json`: `routes[].performance`, `lcpMs`, `tbtMs`, `bundle.totalJsKb`.

## Red flags

- Importing `three`, `gsap`, `cmdk`, `framer-motion` in layout or provider.
- `useEffect` + GSAP on every route change.
- `backdrop-filter: blur()` on many simultaneous HUD cards.
- `setState` on every `mousemove` without need (cursor uses `classList`).
